      "writtenOn": "2018-09-12T08:46:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have been noodling on this since I wrote that comment; thanks for raising this.\n\nThe multi-IpClient work for WifiStateMachine made it clear that having this argument passed as part of the signature would have greatly helped making a single callback usable my all WiFi IpClient instances.\n\nI\u0027m inclined to agree with you, and I\u0027ve removed all my |who|-denigrating text.",
